\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.4}{\ignorespaces Multi-agent coordination architecture. A single \texttt  {retrieve\_all\_sources} node queries all three per-source FAISS indexes sequentially, accumulating five chunks per source. The \texttt  {synthesize} node then issues exactly one LLM call over the pooled fifteen-chunk context. There is no reasoning loop and no iteration limit.}}{34}{figure.3.4}\protected@file@percent }
